resent. The fronds are short and straight rather than long and arching, and the crown is compact compared with the reference."}, {"trait_id": "leaflet-arrangement-stiff-narrow", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "render-0", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "Up close, the leaflets are broad and leaf-like in a flat plane, while the references show them narrow and stiff in a V-section. The bristly silhouette at distance matches only partly."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-leaf-base-diamond-pattern", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "render-3", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "The render shows only sparse isolated stubs on a smooth trunk, with no spiral diamond lattice."}, {"trait_id": "trunk-fibrous-matting", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-2", "render-3", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "The render has no fibre layer; the trunk surface is smooth and uniform."}, {"trait_id": "solitary-columnar-stem", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "explanation": "The render has a single, unbranched, columnar stem of nearly constant diameter."}, {"trait_id": "fruit-clusters-pendent", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0"], "explanation": "No fruit bunches are drawn. The configuration says the date cluster is not landed, and only reference-0 shows fruit."}, {"trait_id": "owner-fronds-long-arching", "status": "fail", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-0", "reference-1"], "explanation": "The rosette reads, and the lowest fronds droop. The fronds are still short and weakly arched compared with the reference."}, {"trait_id": "owner-trunk-straight-constant", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids": ["render-0", "render-1", "reference-1", "reference-2"], "explanation": "The trunk is straight and not wavy, and its diameter is nearly constant in both seeds."}, {"trait_id": "owner-trunk-bare", "status": "pass", "evidence_ids"